  "description": "The new Escape uses our Scandium alloy in a custom drawn, double butted, super oversize tube-set made possible by the new Reveal frame design. The Reveal’s “open style” frame has the same lateral stiffness and ride quality of the famed Sovereign, but at a record breaking 5.6lb for a medium frame (paint adds 1/2lb and couplers will add 1.1lb). The eSCape utilizes the most common sizes for bottom brackets, seatposts, stems and head-sets for easy maintenance.\n\nAlso available with our Z-Couplers for easy travel with the Safecase system. Starting at $6,995 with the Reveal standard build kit and Ultegra 2×11 drivetrain in your choice of gearing.",
